#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of DocBook-utils"
msgstr "Instalação do DocBook-utils"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>DocBook-utils</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>DocBook-utils</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../docbook-utils-&docbook-utils-version;-grep_fix-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i 's:/html::' doc/HTML/Makefile.in                &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --mandir=/usr/share/man      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../docbook-utils-&docbook-utils-version;-grep_fix-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i 's:/html::' doc/HTML/Makefile.in                &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --mandir=/usr/share/man      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make docdir=/usr/share/doc install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make docdir=/usr/share/doc install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Many packages use an alternate name for the <application>DocBook-"
"utils</application> scripts. If you wish to create these alternate names, "
"use the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Muitos pacotes usam um nome alternativo para os conjuntos de comandos "
"sequenciais <application>DocBook-utils</application>. Se você desejar criar "
"esses nomes alternativos, use o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for doctype in html ps dvi man pdf rtf tex texi txt\n"
"do\n"
"    ln -svf docbook2$doctype /usr/bin/db2$doctype\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for doctype in html ps dvi man pdf rtf tex texi txt\n"
"do\n"
"    ln -svf docbook2$doctype /usr/bin/db2$doctype\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>jw</command> script uses the <command>which</command> command "
"to locate required utilities. You must install <xref linkend=\"which\"/> "
"before attempting to use any of the <application>DocBook-utils</application>"
" programs."
msgstr ""
"O conjunto de comandos sequenciais <command>jw</command> usa o comando "
"<command>which</command> para localizar os utilitários exigidos. Você "
"precisa instalar o <xref linkend=\"which\"/> antes de tentar usar qualquer "
"um dos aplicativos <application>DocBook-utils</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>patch -Np1 -i ../docbook-utils-&docbook-utils-"
"version;-grep_fix-1.patch</command>: This patch corrects the syntax in the "
"jw (Jade Wrapper) script which is at the heart of much db2* processing, so "
"that the current version of <application>grep</application> will not reject "
"it."
msgstr ""
"<command>patch -Np1 -i ../docbook-utils-&docbook-utils-"
"version;-grep_fix-1.patch</command>: Esse remendo corrige a sintaxe no "
"conjunto de comandos sequenciais jw (Jade Wrapper), o qual está no centro de"
" grande parte do processamento do db2*, de forma que a versão atual do "
"<application>grep</application> não o rejeitará."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i 's:/html::' doc/HTML/Makefile.in</command>: This command "
"changes the installation directory of the HTML documents."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i 's:/html::' doc/HTML/Makefile.in</command>: Esse comando "
"muda o diretório de instalação dos documentos HTML."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/docbook-utils.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>docdir=/usr/share/doc</parameter>: This option is placed on the "
"<command>make install</command> line because it is not recognized by "
"<command>configure</command>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>docdir=/usr/share/doc</parameter>: Essa opção é colocada na linha"
" <command>make install</command> porque não é reconhecida pelo "
"<command>configure</command>."

